**Example of Enhanced Dependency Check:**
```cpp
if (IsSwitch(*input)) {
  // Check if the Switch's output depends on the Identity node
  if (switch->output().depends_on_identity(node.name())) {
    return false;
  }
  // ... (rest of the loop)
}
```

